## 3️⃣ GET ALL PROPERTIES (Public - No Auth)

### Endpoint
```
GET http://localhost:8080/property/get/all
```

### Headers
```
(No headers needed - public endpoint)
```

---

## 4️⃣ CREATE PROPERTY (Protected - Requires Auth)

### Endpoint
```
POST http://localhost:8080/property/create
```

### Headers
```
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
```

**⚠️ Replace `YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE` with the actual token from login response**

### Property 1 - Luxury Apartment
```json
{
  "propertyName": "Luxury Apartment in Mumbai",
  "propertyType": "Apartment",
  "price": 25000,
  "location": "Bandra, Mumbai",
  "description": "3BHK luxury apartment with sea view",
  "userId": "YOUR_USER_ID_HERE"
}
```

### Property 2 - Villa
```json
{
  "propertyName": "Modern Villa",
  "propertyType": "Villa",
  "price": 50000,
  "location": "Pune",
  "description": "4BHK villa with private garden",
  "userId": "YOUR_USER_ID_HERE"
}
```

### Property 3 - Office Space
```json
{
  "propertyName": "Commercial Office Space",
  "propertyType": "Office",
  "price": 75000,
  "location": "BKC, Mumbai",
  "description": "2000 sq ft office space",
  "userId": "YOUR_USER_ID_HERE"
}
```

**⚠️ Replace `YOUR_USER_ID_HERE` with the actual userId from login response**

---

## 5️⃣ GET USER PROPERTIES (Protected - Requires Auth)

### Endpoint
```
GET http://localhost:8080/property/user/YOUR_USER_ID_HERE
```

### Headers
```
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
```

**⚠️ Replace both `YOUR_USER_ID_HERE` and `YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE`**

---

## 6️⃣ UPDATE PROPERTY (Protected - Requires Auth)

### Endpoint
```
PUT http://localhost:8080/property/update
```

### Headers
```
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
```

### Body
```json
{
  "id": "PROPERTY_ID_HERE",
  "propertyName": "Updated Luxury Apartment",
  "propertyType": "Apartment",
  "price": 30000,
  "location": "Bandra, Mumbai",
  "description": "Updated 3BHK luxury apartment with sea view and parking",
  "userId": "YOUR_USER_ID_HERE"
}
```

---

## 7️⃣ DELETE PROPERTY (Protected - Requires Auth)

### Endpoint
```
DELETE http://localhost:8080/property/delete/PROPERTY_ID_HERE
```

### Headers
```
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
```

**⚠️ Replace `PROPERTY_ID_HERE` with actual property ID**

