POST http://localhost:8080/account/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"John","lastName":"Doe","email":"john.doe@example.com","password":"password123","contactNumber":"9876543210"}
```

**Login:**
```
POST http://localhost:8080/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"john.doe@example.com","password":"password123"}
```

**Create Property (replace token and userId):**
```
POST http://localhost:8080/property/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

{"propertyName":"Luxury Apartment","propertyType":"Apartment","price":25000,"location":"Mumbai","userId":"YOUR_USER_ID"}
```

